    "detailed_description": "Ta-da!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424240/extras/f5694fac7a51429451a96be844116692.avif?t=1715918277\" /></span><br><br>I'm Cygnus, the great sage living at the edge of the forest!<br><br>One day, a demon lord suddenly popped up in the peaceful kingdom of Corvus!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424240/extras/74f05fd58ec2bffb8bcd056da2627e66.avif?t=1715918277\" /></span><br>The king and everyone in the kingdom are gone - what should we do!?<br><br>Ah! There's Lyra!<br>Isn't that Lyra, the loyal knight of the kingdom?<br><br>Let's defeat the demon lord together!<br><br>I have a secret plan.<br>Its name is...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424240/extras/d15d61c98148ce148980bdaff5bc0e9a.avif?t=1715918277\" /></span><br><br>----<br><br><i>Pudding </i>is the 13th title from the Katatema series, a unique and thrilling action-adventure of destruction!<br><br>Features:<br><br>* Minimal buttons! Simple control scheme.<br>* Deal with terrifying attacks easily using tools like the Happiness Ring!<br>* Designed to be fun and easy to play, even for those not skilled in shooting games.<br>* Collect items as you play and admire them in the collection room.<br>* A gradually unfolding world.<br>* A reliable companion always by your side.<br>* All BGMs are new tracks by Watson, and a soundtrack is also available.<br><br>----<br><br>You're welcome to stream this game.<br>Please avoid major spoilers in thumbnails.",
    "about_the_game": "Ta-da!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424240/extras/f5694fac7a51429451a96be844116692.avif?t=1715918277\" /></span><br><br>I'm Cygnus, the great sage living at the edge of the forest!<br><br>One day, a demon lord suddenly popped up in the peaceful kingdom of Corvus!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424240/extras/74f05fd58ec2bffb8bcd056da2627e66.avif?t=1715918277\" /></span><br>The king and everyone in the kingdom are gone - what should we do!?<br><br>Ah! There's Lyra!<br>Isn't that Lyra, the loyal knight of the kingdom?<br><br>Let's defeat the demon lord together!<br><br>I have a secret plan.<br>Its name is...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424240/extras/d15d61c98148ce148980bdaff5bc0e9a.avif?t=1715918277\" /></span><br><br>----<br><br><i>Pudding </i>is the 13th title from the Katatema series, a unique and thrilling action-adventure of destruction!<br><br>Features:<br><br>* Minimal buttons! Simple control scheme.<br>* Deal with terrifying attacks easily using tools like the Happiness Ring!<br>* Designed to be fun and easy to play, even for those not skilled in shooting games.<br>* Collect items as you play and admire them in the collection room.<br>* A gradually unfolding world.<br>* A reliable companion always by your side.<br>* All BGMs are new tracks by Watson, and a soundtrack is also available.<br><br>----<br><br>You're welcome to stream this game.<br>Please avoid major spoilers in thumbnails.",
